fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"codecparsers/gsth266parser.html#GstH266ScalableNesting","fragment":"\n\tGstH266ScalableNesting\n\nMembers\n\n\tGstCodecParsers.H266ScalableNesting\n\nMembers\n\n\tGstCodecParsers.H266ScalableNesting\n\nMembers\nStructure defining the H266 scalable nesting.\nspecifies whether the scalable-nested SEI messages apply to\nspecific OLSs.\nspecifies whether the scalable-nested SEI messages that apply\nto specified OLSs or layers apply only to specific subpictures of the\nspecified OLSs or layers.\nspecifies the number of OLSs to which the scalable-nested\nSEI messages apply.\nis used to derive the variable NestingOlsIdx[i].\nspecifies whether the scalable-nested SEI messages apply to\nall layers that have nuh_layer_id greater than or equal to the nuh_layer_id\nof the current SEI NAL unit.\nspecifies the number of layers to which the\nscalable-nested SEI messages apply.\nspecifies the nuh_layer_id value of the i-th layer to which the\nscalable-nested SEI messages apply.\nspecifies the number of subpictures in each picture in\nthe multiSubpicLayers.\nspecifies the number of bits used to represent the\nsyntax element sn_subpic_id[i].\nindicates the subpicture ID of the i-th subpicture in each\npicture in the multiSubpicLayers.\nspecifies the number of scalable-nested SEI messages.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\nStructure defining the H266 scalable nesting.\nspecifies whether the scalable-nested SEI messages apply to\nspecific OLSs.\nspecifies whether the scalable-nested SEI messages that apply\nto specified OLSs or layers apply only to specific subpictures of the\nspecified OLSs or layers.\nspecifies the number of OLSs to which the scalable-nested\nSEI messages apply.\nis used to derive the variable NestingOlsIdx[i].\nspecifies whether the scalable-nested SEI messages apply to\nall layers that have nuh_layer_id greater than or equal to the nuh_layer_id\nof the current SEI NAL unit.\nspecifies the number of layers to which the\nscalable-nested SEI messages apply.\nspecifies the nuh_layer_id value of the i-th layer to which the\nscalable-nested SEI messages apply.\nspecifies the number of subpictures in each picture in\nthe multiSubpicLayers.\nspecifies the number of bits used to represent the\nsyntax element sn_subpic_id[i].\nindicates the subpicture ID of the i-th subpicture in each\npicture in the multiSubpicLayers.\nspecifies the number of scalable-nested SEI messages.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\nStructure defining the H266 scalable nesting.\nspecifies whether the scalable-nested SEI messages apply to\nspecific OLSs.\nspecifies whether the scalable-nested SEI messages that apply\nto specified OLSs or layers apply only to specific subpictures of the\nspecified OLSs or layers.\nspecifies the number of OLSs to which the scalable-nested\nSEI messages apply.\nis used to derive the variable NestingOlsIdx[i].\nspecifies whether the scalable-nested SEI messages apply to\nall layers that have nuh_layer_id greater than or equal to the nuh_layer_id\nof the current SEI NAL unit.\nspecifies the number of layers to which the\nscalable-nested SEI messages apply.\nspecifies the nuh_layer_id value of the i-th layer to which the\nscalable-nested SEI messages apply.\nspecifies the number of subpictures in each picture in\nthe multiSubpicLayers.\nspecifies the number of bits used to represent the\nsyntax element sn_subpic_id[i].\nindicates the subpicture ID of the i-th subpicture in each\npicture in the multiSubpicLayers.\nspecifies the number of scalable-nested SEI messages.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\n"});